<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
		<title>Page not found · Good Gateway</title>
		<style>
			:root { color-scheme: light dark; font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif; }
			body { min-height: 100svh; margin: 0; display: grid; place-items: center; background: Canvas; color: CanvasText; }
			main { width: min(42rem, calc(100% - 3rem)); }
			h1 { margin: 0 0 1rem; font-size: clamp(3rem, 10vw, 7rem); letter-spacing: -0.06em; }
			p { max-width: 34rem; color: color-mix(in srgb, CanvasText 70%, transparent); line-height: 1.6; }
			nav { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
			a { border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, CanvasText 22%, transparent); padding: 0.75rem 1rem; color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
			a:first-child { border-color: #6d5ce7; background: #5d4bcc; color: white; }
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<main>
			<h1>404</h1>
			<p>The requested documentation page does not exist. Запрошенная страница документации не существует.</p>
			<nav aria-label="Documentation languages">
				<a href="/en/">Open English documentation</a>
				<a href="/ru/">Открыть документацию на русском</a>
			</nav>
		</main>
	</body>
</html>
